  "term": "sex therapy",
  "definition": "Sex therapy is a therapeutic approach used to help couples address sexual concerns and improve intimacy. In this packet, it appears as part of a phone-based couple intervention that uses education and skills training to strengthen physical and emotional closeness after breast cancer diagnosis and treatment.",
